Replaces dev's own implementations of the layer-wise distributed optimizer (Muon), its sibling `DistributedOptimizer` and Muon's QKV handling with the converged code of the main PR #8919. If both PRs merge, main and dev carry one implementation of this area.

Dev-only features stay as they are. They include:
- chunked optimizer-state offload;
- torch_memory_saver buffers without CPU backup;
- the Megatron-FSDP options;
